      "text": "**Bolesław I \"Chrobry\" (the Brave)** (r. 992–1025): First Polish king (crowned 1025). Expanded into: Bohemia, Moravia, Lusatia, Silesia, Red Ruthenia. A brief pan-Slavic empire — didn't last past his death."
    },
