      "text": "CONSEQUENCE: Poland spent 180 years fragmented into competing\n  principalities (like Germany but without even the HRE fiction)\n  Polish fragmentation enabled:\n  - Teutonic Order conquest of Prussia (1230–1283)\n  - Mongol devastation (1241 — Battle of Legnica)\n  - German colonization of Silesia, Pomerania, other territories\n  - Loss of Silesia to Bohemia permanently (by 1335)\n```"
